    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-handed mode? Yes, it\u2019s here \u2013 because everyone is a player. In OMEXYAN, this feature was primarily designed for those living with physical challenges, but it\u2019s open to anyone who prefers a more comfortable or simply different way to play. Our goal was to make sure that everyone, under any circumstances, can fully enjoy the championship of the universe.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/extras/22104daa8ef0bf8cb6754edeff828cdd.avif?t=1754165298\" data-has-big width=800 height=604 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills and become the champion of the Universal Games!</strong> <br>The galaxy is watching you in this <strong>once-in-a-millennium competition</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>OMEXYAN</strong>, where movement, rhythm, and skill rule the arena! Feel the adrenaline in this dynamic VR game that challenges your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dive into the world of OMEXYAN, where reflexes, precision, and skill dominate in an exciting VR adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the color-catching devices in your hands to collect incoming red and green orbs. Then, control two colorful remote devices to aim at and hit the matching-colored cubes accurately. In the third challenge, wield a sporty laser weapon to shoot the correct-colored targets with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points, unlock new levels and arenas, and face increasingly challenging and diverse tasks. With a fast-paced soundtrack accompanying your gameplay, OMEXYAN ensures you\u2019re fully immersed in a dynamic and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on skill-based challenges and dynamic VR gameplay, offering exciting and captivating entertainment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills and become the champion of the Universal Games!</strong> <br>The galaxy is watching you in this <strong>once-in-a-millennium competition</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>OMEXYAN</strong>, where movement, rhythm, and skill rule the arena! Feel the adrenaline in this dynamic VR game that challenges your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dive into the world of OMEXYAN, where reflexes, precision, and skill dominate in an exciting VR adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the color-catching devices in your hands to collect incoming red and green orbs. Then, control two colorful remote devices to aim at and hit the matching-colored cubes accurately. In the third challenge, wield a sporty laser weapon to shoot the correct-colored targets with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points, unlock new levels and arenas, and face increasingly challenging and diverse tasks. With a fast-paced soundtrack accompanying your gameplay, OMEXYAN ensures you\u2019re fully immersed in a dynamic and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on skill-based challenges and dynamic VR gameplay, offering exciting and captivating entertainment.</p>",
    "short_description": "Are you ready to rise as the champion of the galaxy? OMEXYAN \u2013 the game that only gives the best a chance every 1000 years!Skill-based VR game where you match colors, hit objects, and dodge obstacles \u2013 all set to dynamic music and thrilling challenges!",
